# TicketHub requests. In VS Code, install the "REST Client" extension and click "Send Request".
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080
@operaGala = d3993281-50a8-584b-97cd-bebc4758626a

### List all events
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/events

### Get one event (Opera Gala: 1 seat left)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/events/{{operaGala}}

### Book 4 tickets for the Opera Gala
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/events/{{operaGala}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerEmail": "demo.customer@example.com",
  "quantity": 4
}

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
